    <Geometry x:Key="IconGlobe">M12,21 C16.97,21 21,16.97 21,12 C21,7.03 16.97,3 12,3 C7.03,3 3,7.03 3,12 C3,16.97 7.03,21 12,21 Z M3,12 L21,12 M12,3 C14.5,5.5 15.7,8.6 15.7,12 C15.7,15.4 14.5,18.5 12,21 C9.5,18.5 8.3,15.4 8.3,12 C8.3,8.6 9.5,5.5 12,3 Z</Geometry>
